{
  "name": "marketing-outreach-architect",
  "description": "Parent orchestrator that reproduces an entire MarketingOutreach-shaped project (targets, intel, contact pages, pitch decks, pricing models, reviewer briefs, master playbook) as DOCX/PPTX/HTML/XLSX from a single business_pack. Composes company-naming-pipeline (optional), trademark-clearance-pipeline (optional), vertical-scaffolder, outreach-engine, pricing-model-writer, reviewer-brief-writer, and artifact-codegen. Supports N verticals in one pass; designed so a non-technical operator can fill one input pack (past deals + product base + company history + mission statement) and get a complete outreach-ready package back.",
